                                                "sense_id": "8098cfc7-5069-3c9f-bcbe-80e9c8ca1f8f",
                                                "text": "In this video, Lee and Hurwitz construct a finely calibrated landscape of a transmasculinity made up of heterosexual FTMs, queer-identified FTMs, gay male FTMs, transfags, and transbutches, although none of these terms is mutually exclusive."
                                            },
                                            {
