                                                "sense_id": "8098cfc7-5069-3c9f-bcbe-80e9c8ca1f8f",
                                                "text": "Transbutches embody a third space (with others) between the uncritical celebration of “womanhood” and its rejection entirely."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "587178ef-5f9e-412b-8089-88c861f49b56",
                                                "sense_id": "8098cfc7-5069-3c9f-bcbe-80e9c8ca1f8f",
                                                "text": "I know so many transbutches who remain in the dark and I wanted to let them know it's ok to be themselves."
